nd associate a station and send traffic.  Change-Id: I5d3d475161fd2321791f71e4f39d6893bf8a8d12 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/304125 Commit-Ready: Srinivasa duvvuri &lt;sduvvuri@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Srinivasa duvvuri &lt;sduvvuri@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Srinivasa duvvuri &lt;sduvvuri@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Yixiang Li &lt;yixiang@google.com&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="304125" owner_email="sduvvuri@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="3" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/25/304125/3" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I0ace7b22120c0679fcdf75d5cd5ecafb56338aa2" commit="e3be71142d7077669340c1b039ffb9d44d5898be" commit_message="veyron_rialto: Disable LP_VIDEO_CONSOLE  This feature isn't useful on Rialto and causes compilation issues.  BUG=chrome-os-partner:46148 BRANCH=none TEST=built and booted on Rialto  Change-Id: I0ace7b22120c0679fcdf75d5cd5ecafb56338aa2 Signed-off-by: David Hendricks &lt;dhendrix@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/304072 Reviewed-by: Alexandru Stan &lt;amstan@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="1" gerrit_number="304072" owner_email="dhendrix@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/72/304072/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="1"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ib1b816214e39ca8172e7b09d18e1136c14a546da" commit="d6f9fc5e6d830519f0802d7992c0144761883194" commit_message="udev: drop old 208  Now that 216 is stable, we can drop this old version.  BUG=chromium:455336 TEST=pre-cq passes  Change-Id: Ib1b816214e39ca8172e7b09d18e1136c14a546da Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/304210 Commit-Ready: Mike Frysinger 